      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我說爺爺～\n我的獨劍鞘沒什麼活力。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n幫牠回復之後也是無精打采的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118AAA723A723AFF5E000A621176847368528D97986C924EC09EBC6D3B529B300200100001BE00000A5E6B726056DE5FA94E4B5F8C4E5F662F71217CBE625391C77684300200100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呵呵……那是因為啊，\n牠的劍變鈍啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "547554752026202690A3662F56E070BA554AFF0C000A72607684528D8B8A920D5566FF01001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那你說，\n我該怎麼幫牠呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34F608AAAFF0C000A62118A72600E9EBC5E6B72605462FF1F00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要說幫刀劍寶可夢獨劍鞘\n恢復鋒利度的方法，那就是……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89818AAA5E6B5200528D5BF653EF59227368528D9798000A60625FA992D252295EA6768465B96CD5FF0C90A35C31662F20262026001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沙基拉斯！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C9957FA62C965AFFF01001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為什麼！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4EC09EBCFF01FF1F00100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "隨著一而再，再而三去劈砍\n沙基拉斯堅硬的身體，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n獨劍鞘的劍也就會再次變鋒利啦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96A884574E00800C518DFF0C518D800C4E0953BB5288780D000A6C9957FA62C965AF5805786C76848EAB9AD4FF0C00100001BE00000A7368528D97987684528D4E5F5C316703518D6B218B8A92D252295566FF01001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真的嗎？可是突然說需要\n有隻沙基拉斯，那也太……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F768455CEFF1F53EF662F7A8171368AAA97008981000A670996BB6C9957FA62C965AFFF0C90A34E5F592A2026202600100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！這位<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂ哥哥姐姐！\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有沒有捉到沙基拉斯？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n來和我的獨劍鞘對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF0190194F4D00100003110000FF020254E554E559D059D0FF01000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B367096C926709634952306C9957FA62C965AFFF1F00100001BE00000A4F86548C621176847368528D97985C0D62305427FF0100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "讓同行隊伍只有1隻沙基拉斯，\n然後和我的獨劍鞘對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
