      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鏘！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "93D8FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦？獨劍鞘恢復精神了？\n太厲害了，爺爺！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF1F7368528D979860625FA97CBE795E4E86FF1F000A592A53B25BB34E86FF0C723A723AFF0100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哈～哈哈！\n我就說吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C8FF5E54C854C8FF01000A62115C318AAA54273002001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沙基拉斯是重要關鍵！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C9957FA62C965AF662F91CD898195DC9375FF01001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當然，這麼做對沙基拉斯牠\n也是件好事呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75767136FF0C90199EBC505A5C0D6C9957FA62C965AF7260000A4E5F662F4EF6597D4E8B54623002001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這樣子確認身體有多堅硬之後，\n牠就能放心進化了啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90196A235B5078BA8A8D8EAB9AD46709591A5805786C4E4B5F8CFF0C000A72605C3180FD653E5FC3903253164E86554AFF01001000020114001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "聽起來好像在唬我……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "807D8D774F86597D50CF5728552C62112026202600100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但這下獨劍鞘牠又是精神百倍了，\n真是太感謝沙基拉斯啦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4690194E0B7368528D9798726053C8662F7CBE795E767E500D4E86FF0C000A771F662F592A611F8B1D6C9957FA62C965AF5566FF0100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也要謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫我的獨劍鞘\n恢復了活力！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F89818B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B621176847368528D9798000A60625FA94E866D3B529BFF0100100002011401660000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
